This license covers the code in this repository only.

It does NOT cover FEX-Emu, Wine, DXMT, or the Apple Game Porting Toolkit. Those
are separate projects with their own licenses, and the runtime loads or links
them rather than incorporating them. Read third_party/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md
before redistributing a build.

Two cases need care:

  * If you statically link Wine's LGPL-2.1-or-later libraries into a binary you
    distribute, LGPL-2.1 §6 applies to that binary and you must let recipients
    relink it against a modified Wine.
  * DXMT and FEX-Emu are MIT, so their licenses place no condition on this
    project's licensing.
